window.products.push({"id":87027,"name":"Joy Pebble Beverage Cooler and Refrigerator 90 Can Mini Fridge with Glass Door for Soda Beer or Wine Small Drink Cooler for Home Office or Bar (3.2 cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":289.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q0y1jLYKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MODERN ELECTRIC BEVERAGE COOLER】This 3.2 cubic feet, free standing beverage refrigerator features see through, left hinge glass front door with stainless steel frame. The blue LED light can help you easily find your favorite wine, beer, drink at night. 【EFFECTIVE COOLING】Beverage refrigerator is engineered with a powerful compressor and convection fan to evenly distribute cold air throughout the cabinet to prevent hot spots, frosting and uneven cooling. 【HIGH CAPACITY】Under counter beverage cooler with large, internal storage design is equipped with 5 adjustable and removable chrome shelves.It’s an organizer that conveniently holds up to 90 standard sized soda, water. Size: 17.7” W x 29.1” H x 16.9” D 【IDEAL LIGHT & HUMIDITY】Double Pane Glass Door can block out harmful UV rays and help to maintain an ideal humidity level. Blue soft LED interior lighting not only beautifully showcases the beverage or wine. 【ULTRA QUIET OPERATION】Equipped with an advanced cooling system that will keep your beverages at the right temperature without making a noise. Warning: Do not use this cooler to store fresh foods, it can only be used to chill beverages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q0y1jLYKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joy Pebble","source_asin":"B08161Y738","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08161Y738","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08161Y738","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":87028,"name":"WP3406107 3406107 Dryer Door Switch Whirlpool Maytag Kenmore Part Number Replacement AED4475TQ1 MEDC400VW0 AGD4475TQ1 NED4700YQ1 NED4600YQ1 WED4800XQ0","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xMEBuQVMS.jpg","description":"💡 Kenmore Dryer Switch 3406107 - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers WP3406107, AP6008561, 3405100, 3405101, 3406100, 3406101, 528948, PS11741701, WP3406107VP. Door Switch Wp3406107 is compatible with Whirlpool, Admiral, Amana, Crosley, Estate, Inglis, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Magic Chef, Maytag, Roper. Whirlpool 3406107 is designed to ensure that the dryer stops running when the door is opened, and it is an essential safety feature to prevent injuries or accidents. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Part Number 3406107? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Maytag Dryer Switch 3406107 will help if the dryer doesn't start, doesn't shut off, doesn't tumble, or shuts off too soon. Door Switch 3406107 is usually located near the top of the door opening, and it is held in place by two screws. Unplug your appliance before the repair process. 💡 Whirlpool Dryer Door Switch Wp3406107 is an important safety feature in a dryer, as it prevents the dryer from running when the door is open. If the switch is not functioning properly, the dryer may continue to run even when the door is open, which can pose a risk of injury or damage to the machine. Kenmore Dryer Door Switch Wp3406107 meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How do I test my Whirlpool dryer door switch? The steps involve disconnecting the wires from the switch, setting the multimeter to the ohms setting, testing the switch by touching the probes of the multimeter to the two terminals of the switch, and checking the reading. If the switch is defective, it needs to be replaced. Testing the 3406107 Whirlpool Dryer Door Switch Replacement is a simple process that can ensure the safe operation of your dryer. 💡 Is there a way to bypass the dryer door switch? Bypassing a dryer door switch is not recommended as it can pose serious safety hazards. Dryer Switch Wp3406107 is a safety feature designed to prevent the dryer from running when the door is open. Bypassing the switch can cause the dryer to operate even when the door is open, which can result in injury or property damage. If you suspect that the door switch is faulty, it is best to replace it rather than bypass it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xMEBuQVMS.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07KPMB4NG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPMB4NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPMB4NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
