window.products.push({"id":87286,"name":"Vremi Black Portable Ice Cube Maker - Produces 26 Pounds of Ice Cubes a Day - Display Panel Indicator with Removable Ice Basket and Scoop - Modern Cou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uPaFBJAOL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Vremi Portable Countertop Ice Maker, you’ll never run out of ice when you need it. Our energy-efficient compact ice making machine keeps parties and family dinners alive with ice whenever and wherever you need it. In just 8 to 10 minutes, you’ll have smooth, bullet-shaped ice that makes any drink cooler. We make ice easy; with our ice maker, there’s no complex installation to worry about and our automatic shut-off function and warning lights help stop problems before they start. With a new, easy-to-use control panel and a modern silver and black finish, it’s perfect for kitchens, an RV, boats, bars, patios and more! Your drinks will be cool and your gatherings chill. Enjoy easy, breezy, and freezy fun with the Vremi Countertop Ice Maker. Product Details & Features. Ice maker size: 9.5 x 12 x 13.5 inches. Weight: 23.6 lbs. Material: ABS Plastic interior, Stainless Steel exterior. Water reservoir capacity: 2.2 liters. Ice production: 26 lbs of ice in 24 hours. Ice basket capacity: 1.5 lbs. Ice time: Ready in 8 to 10 minutes. Power: 120 V. Smooth bullet-shaped ice cubes. Auto shut off when ice is full. Warning lights when water needs to be refilled. Easy to fill and drain water quickly. Simple-to-use control panel. Comes with a small ice scoop and removable ice basket. Certifications: WaterSense, ETL Certified. IMPORTANT THINGS TO KNOW: If the machine has been in any other position than upright, leave it upright for 24 hours for the coolant to settle. Wash the tray and scoop in warm soapy water before using. For full instructions and safety warnings, always refer to the Vremi product box or manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uPaFBJAOL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vremi","source_asin":"B07H7SGQ52","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H7SGQ52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H7SGQ52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
