window.products.push({"id":87328,"name":"My-Cap Sampler - Complete Solution to Make Your Own Capsules for Nespresso VertuoLine Brewers (Combo)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JOVZFzz4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<b>DRINK NOW:</b> Our exclusive REUSABLE SILICONE CAP is used on a pod for an immediate cup of coffee. Add an included filter under the cap to prevent coffee grounds from entering the brew, and the result is an exceptional cup of coffee, crema or espresso. Our GREY REUSABLE PLASTIC CAP works the same way as the reusable silicone caps, but because this cap is plastic and not silicone, it is only compatible with certain machines. See images for details for machine compatibility for both caps. SAVE FOR LATER: Our FOILS attach to the edge of the pods and are easily pressed into position for an air-tight, well-sealed capsule that provides clean puncture holes and no foil tears. The REUSABLE SILICONE LID is great for preparing pods in advance. The air-tight lid keeps coffee grounds fresh and ready for use for 7-14 days. Add a filter, cap and lid, then remove the lid and place the pod in the machine when ready to begin brewing. Compatible with all VertuoLine pods. PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 reusable silicone cap and lid (color varies), 1 grey reusable plastic cap, 20 filters, 50 foil seals, 1 capsule holder, 1 funnel, 1 coffee scoop, 1 cleaning brush and instructions. All items are made from BPA-free and food-grade materials. AMERICAN COMPANY: My-Cap is the only U.S.-Based company selling these products. My-Cap is the inventor of the original reusable coffee pods. DISCLAIMER: Nespresso and their logos are brands registered by Société des Produits Nestlé SA. Brand names and references of machine models are made solely with the aim of indicating our products compatibility. Our products and company are not associated in any way with the above companies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JOVZFzz4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My-Cap","source_asin":"B07ZTPQQ7P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZTPQQ7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZTPQQ7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":87329,"name":"Hoovy Anti-Vibration Pads For Washing Machines & Dryers – Set Of Shock Absorbing Rubber Feet – Universal Anti-Walk For All Laundry Appliances – Reduce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u8-QvDD2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Noisy washing machines are a thing of the past! Hoovy presents you with this 4-piece set of anti-vibration pads that absorb the vibrations and shocks of your washing machine and dryer machine. By installing these anti-vibration pads under the 4 corners of your washing machine, you will never have to deal with loud noises and vibrations again. The non-slip washing machine feet also keep the washing machine in place, so you don't have to slide it back into place after each wash. Ensure the longevity of your washing machine and floors. By absorbing the vibrations of your washing machine, these anti-slip pads prevent damage and reduce maintenance costs. At the same time, the dryer anti-vibration pads protect your floors by preventing abrasion, scratches, cracks and discoloration. In other words, Hoovy's dryer pads help you save both money and the longevity of your expensive washing machine and floors. Compatible with all washing machines and dryers. Thanks to their universal design, these anti-vibration pads are suitable for washing machines and dryers, regardless of make, model and size. In fact, the durable rubber anti-vibration pads can hold up to the heaviest of washing machines - Hoovy has you covered! This is a completely risk-free purchase. The Hoovys laundry anti-vibration pads come with a 5-year money-back guarantee from the date of purchase. If for any reason you are not satisfied with the quality and effectiveness of these washing machine pads, you can return them for a full refund. Don't hold back any longer! Scroll up and click \"Add to Cart\" now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u8-QvDD2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoovy","source_asin":"B07JBPBHD4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JBPBHD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JBPBHD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":87330,"name":"Antarctic Star 26 Bottle Wine Cooler/Cabinet Beverage Refrigerator Mini Wine Cellar Beer Soda Clear Glass Door Counter Top Bar Fridge Quiet Compressor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719uLuKv+GL._AC_SL1412_.jpg","description":"KEEP WINE COOL: Heat is enemy number one for wine. The Wine Cooler enables you to store your wine in optimal conditions for long-term aging. Working temperature range is 40°F- 61°F, and allows you to customize the temp (55°F is often cited as close to perfect). IDEAL LIGHT and HUMIDITY: The reinforced glass door with air tight seal helps to maintain an ideal humidity level, this beverage refrigerator gives you a compact and modern sensation. Perfect for your living room. Blue soft LED interior lighting not only beautifully showcases the wine but won’t damage the wine. PERFECT WINE STORAGE: 26 standard wine bottles capacity, also perfect for canned beer and beverage storage. Horizontal racking is a space-efficient way to store your bottles, and it definitely can't harm your wines. NO VIBRATION and QUIET: Equipped with an advanced cooling system that will keep your beverages at the right temperature without making any noise. With no disturbance to its natural occurring sediments. Equipped with Movable Black Shelves, Glass Door and Adjustable Leveling Legs. FREESTANDING: Freestanding application only, NOT for built in use. The beverage and wine center door will close more easily when the two front leveling legs are extended slightly. NOTE: For your safety, please reserve at least 5 inchs on each side for cooler installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719uLuKv+GL._AC_SL1412_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antarctic Star","source_asin":"B0C4TLWPCD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4TLWPCD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4TLWPCD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
