window.products.push({"id":87519,"name":"Techecook 5301EL1001A Dryer Heating Element Assembly - Compatible with Ken-more L-G Dryer - Replaces 5301EL1001J 5301EL1001E 5301EL1001G 5301EL1001H 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610SB7JTGkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 【5301EL1001A HEATING ELEMENT】---The 5301EL1001A heating element is made of high quality metal materials, the heating coil is made of nickel and chromium alloy with up to 85% nickel content, which can effectively heat in the electric dryer. Dryer Heating Element Assembly 5301EL1001A has a high resistance that prevents itself from breaking and burning out, not easily deformed in high temperature use, effectively prolong the service life. ✅ 【PACKAGE INCLUDES】---Including 1 x 5301EL1001A Dryer Heating Element Assembly. 5301EL1001A Dryer Heating Element includes housing, wiring, heater, 6931EL3001E 2-wire dryer thermostat and 6931EL3003D High Limit Thermal Fuse. High Limit Thermostat & Thermal Fuse is included and assembled on Heater Housing. Rated at 5400 Watts 240 Volts and has 2- 5/16\" male terminals. Dryer heating element Assembly generates the dryer's heat. ✅ 【COMPATIBLE MODEL】---Dryer heating element 5301EL1001A replacement for Ken-more, L-G Dryer. ►Replaces 5301EL1001J, 5301EL1001E, 5301EL1001G, 5301EL1001H, 5301EL1001U, 5301EL1001W, AEG72910301, AP4439759, 1377645, PS3527791, EAP3527791. ►Replaces 79681473210, DLE5977S, DLE5977SM, DLE9577SM, DLE0332W, DLE3733U, DLE2532W, DLE5932W, DLE8377NM, DLE5977WM, DLE1310W, DLE3777E, DLE5932S, DLE5977BM, DLE5977B, DLE6942W, DLE7177RM, DLE8377WM, DLE9577WM, DLE2101W, CDE3379WD, CDE3379WN, DLE3777W, etc. ✅ 【NOTE & FIX THE SYMPTOMS】---➊Please note: If your dryer has three terminals at the temperature control, the 5301EL1001H or 5301EL1001J is more suitable for your model. ➋If your dryer is too hot, has no heat or insufficient heat, takes too long to dry, will not shut off, trips the circuit breaker, you may have a fault 5301EL1001A L-G dryer heating element and you need to replace it with a new element. ✅ 【365 DAYS WARRANTY】---Risk-free shopping. During the 365 days warranty period, If the 5301EL1001A dryer heating element has quality problem or you do not like it, we support return, replacement or refund. We are committed to providing the highest quality products and best prices to create the highest quality life for you. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit ✅ 【DIY INSTALLATION】---Disconnect the power before installing 5301EL1001A Dryer Heating Element Assembly. And wear work gloves to protect your hands. Installing the dryer heating element is very simple. If you're not sure how to install the 5301EL1001A dryer heating element, you can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it to install it. We are committed to providing economical DIY repair solutions for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610SB7JTGkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B0991PLYD6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0991PLYD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0991PLYD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
