window.products.push({"id":87530,"name":"279816 Dryer Thermal Cut-off Kit Whirlpool Kenmore Thermostat Part Cutoff Fuse AP3094244 Maytag Amana Wed4815ew1 Wed5000dw2 Medx655dw1 Ned4655ew1 Wed6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lZT7oh9TS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Whirlpool 279816 Thermostat Kit For Dryer - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP3094244, 2651, 279816VP, 3399848, AH334299, EA334299, PS334299, 3977393. 279816 Thermostat Kit For Dryer is compatible with Whirlpool, Admiral, Amana, Crosley, Estate, Inglis, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Magic Chef, Maytag, Roper. Whirlpool 279816 Kit consists of a thermal cut-off fuse and a thermostat that work together to prevent the dryer from overheating. It comes in silver and is made of metal. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. 279816 Thermal Cutoff Kit will help if there is no heat or not enough heat, it takes too long to dry, it doesn't start, or it's too hot. The Whirlpool Dryer 279816 Cut-off Kit is designed to be an easy-to-install replacement for both the thermal cut-off fuse and the high-limit thermostat. 💡 The 279816 Thermal Cutoff Kit is a part that stops the dryer from overheating if the high-limit thermostat fails and creates a closed circuit. If this happens, the dryer may not generate heat. The Thermal Cutoff Kit 279816 has one thermostat (250 degrees limit), one thermal cut-off fuse (309 degrees), jumper wires, and female spade terminals. 279816 Dryer Thermostat Kit Replacement meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Can a dryer work without a thermostat? A dryer cannot work without a thermostat. The thermostat is a critical component of the dryer's heating system and is responsible for regulating the temperature inside the dryer drum. Without a thermostat, the dryer would not be able to maintain a consistent temperature, which would result in poor drying performance and could potentially damage your clothes. 💡 Popular Models: 110.61202011, 110.61402311, 110.64742400, 110.65102310, 110.65132411, aed4675yq1, eed4300vq0, ied4300sq0, ies5000rq0, leq9508lw0, ler4634eq0, ler4634eq1, ler4634jq1, ler5636pq1, ler6620pq1, medc200xw1, medc200xw3, medc215ew0, medc300bw0, medc300xw0, medc400bw1, medc400vw0, medx655dw0, ned4655ew0, ned4700yq1, red4100sq0, red4440vq1, red4640yq0, rex4634kq1, teds740pq0, wed4750xq0, wed4800bq1, wed4800xq0, wed4800xq1, wed4800xq3, wed4815ew0, wed4850bw0, wed4900xw0, wed5100vq1.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lZT7oh9TS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07Z8JD3JW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z8JD3JW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z8JD3JW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
