window.products.push({"id":87532,"name":"KUPPET Full-Automatic Washing Machine 13lbs Portable Compact 2 in 1 Laundry Washer with Drain Pump, 10 Programs 8 Water Level Selections with LED Disp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XeXcOa1xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👕【Full-Automatic System】With KUPPET fully automatic washing machine, you only need to set the washing/spinning program, and then it can work alone. The washing machine has a drain pipe, allowing you to easily discharge dirty water. 🔄【Multi-Function Control Panel】There are ten programs on the control panel, eight water level selection and LED display. All functions and operations are clearly listed, including water level/rotation, program/delay, time setting and child lock. It also includes detergent and program options to meet your various needs. 🏠【Compact Design & Large Load Capacity】KUPPET washing machine is compact and lightweight for you to easily move it in your home. The honeycomb shaped inner tub can load 13lbs at one time and wash many clothes for you. Suitable for dorms, apartment, condos, RV's, camping and more. 🔼【Automatic Imbalance Adjustment and Adjustable Foot】While spinning, if the laundries inside the tub are not put equally, it would cause violent vibration. At this time, KUPPET portable washing machine’s imbalance adjustment function will start automatically to adjust the imbalance situation if vibration is beyond certain level. Bottom feet can be adjusted to meet your needs. 🔐【Easy and Safe to Operate】This product has intuitive illustrations and instructions. No installation and easy operation. The transparent lid allows you to view and monitor the water and washing conditions.If the top cover is opened, the rotating tub will stop working first, and the machine gives an error alarm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XeXcOa1xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUPPET","source_asin":"B08LVHYLST","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LVHYLST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LVHYLST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
