window.products.push({"id":87635,"name":"EUHOMY Ice Maker Machine Countertop, 2 Ways to Add Water,45Lbs/Day 24 Pcs Ready in 13 Mins, Self-Cleaning Portable Compact Ice Cube Maker with Ice Sco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":152.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vm5Vm6loL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 Ways to Add Water -BOTTLE NOT INCLUDED- The countertop ice maker machine holds up to 3.2 liters of water, minimizing how often you need to refill it. At the same time, you can also insert a 3 gallon drinking water bucket into the ice maker water storage tank. You won’t worry there is not enough water to make ice cubes. AUTOMATIC CLEANING FUNCTION - Press the \"TIMER\" button for more than 5 seconds to enter the automatic cleaning function. Please clean your ice machine regularly) HIGH-QUALITY ICE CUBES & Reservation- Euhomy’s countertop ice maker machine can produces 24 ice cubes per cycle (every 12 to 18 minutes). That means you can make up to 44 pounds of ice cubes every 24 hours. Best of all, you can adjust the thickness of the ice cubes according to your needs, letting you create perfect drinks. Ice Making Reservation - You can set an appointment to make ice cubes with our counter ice maker machine. Press the \"TIMER\" button once and set the reservation time. LCD & DIGITAL DISPLAY - Euhomy ice machine holds an LCD display which makes the ice machine easier to use. Features an easy-to-read push-button digital design for comfortable use. Timer with up to 8-hour delay. Offers on-time ice production. When there is not enough water in the water tank, the indicator will light up, reminding you to add more water. Or when the ice bucket is full, the ice maker will remind you to remove the extra ice cubes, so the ice maker can start to make more ice. Food-Safe Material & Super Quiet - The material we use for the ice maker is Food-Safe and anti- corrosion. Therefore don’t be worry when you are using the countertop ice maker. Around 45db sound level won’t disturb you even the cat. One Year Warranty & Accessories - Euhomy offers a 12-month warranty and lifetime support for ice makers. Customer satisfaction is our first consideration. if you have any problems, please feel free to contact us. Each portable ice maker is equipped with an ice basket and an ice shovel. Make sure that these accessories are present when you receive the goods, and if there are any missing, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vm5Vm6loL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B09133YZL4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09133YZL4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09133YZL4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
