window.products.push({"id":87990,"name":"TTODDE 58.5mm Espresso Puck Screen/Coffee Portafilter Puck Screen/Espresso Portafilter Lower Shower Screen/Reusable Contact Screen 1.7mm Thickness 150","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FEUgK3AaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A great addition to an espresso machine brew: This espresso puck screen will even out water flow and help hold the puck together, preventing it from breaking down under pressure, which can lead to channeling and jetting. Extraction will be smoother, more even and balanced, resulting in a higher fat content in liquid coffee and a more mellow coffee taste. High Filtration Quality: The espresso puck screen uses a 150μm filter mesh, which is superior to other common mesh filters on the market. Multi-layer sintering, fine grinding of the edge, high strength, good filtering effect, can better promote the full extraction of coffee powder. Suitable for pressurized water flow without backflow and damage to your machine. Keep the brew head clean: Protects the brew head from being sucked away when the lever is lifted. Prevents the coffee from coming into direct contact with the shower screen, thus preventing the brewing head from getting dirty and simplifying the cleaning process. The Espresso Puck Strainer can be easily washed under the tap to remove any residue inside. Premium Materials and Construction: This Puck screen is stamped from 1.7mm thick multi-layer 150μm food grade stainless steel mesh, it will not bend after use, it is reusable. Note: The pellets need to be pulled down at a higher water temperature (+2~3°C) due to the solid metal mesh. It is recommended to increase the water temperature by 2-4°C. /Given the thermal mass of the screen, it is recommended to place it in a mobile filter and lock it before turning on the preheat controls. Compatible with ESPRESSO MACHINE mobile filter (58mm/53.5mm/51mm) filter basket, Group E61 first class commercial espresso machine (58.5mm), also suitable for home, office or cafe etc. Please confirm the size you need when purchasing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FEUgK3AaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TTODDE","source_asin":"B0BZGSHQ8B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-87990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZGSHQ8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZGSHQ8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
